**🧧 Supported Versions:**
- 1.21.8
- 1.21.10
- 1.21.11 *[LTS]*
- 26.1 *[LTS]*
- 26.1.1 & 26.1.2
- 26.2
- 26.3-snapshot-10 *[TS]*

**🔌 Supported ModLoaders:**
- Fabric
- NeoForge
- Sponge
- Paper

**🪵 Changelog:**
- [Paper] Fix AvoidInternal#getServer()
- [Paper] Fix CommandSystem player executors
- AvoidWrappedLoader#isPaper()
- '.avoid.zip' mod filetype support<br/>
  *(alias to JAR, made to suppress parent loader warnings about invalid mod files)*
- Mark Paper builds as compatible with Purpur
- Avoid version text on the titlescreen on non-NeoForge platforms
- [Entity API] #isLocal()
- [ModLoader] A lot of mod-loading events
- [Client Loading] Screen Render Mojang Event
- [Server Entity] Inside Block Event
- [Server Mob] Set Target Event, Clear Target Event
- [Effect API] #onMobHurt()

**🪵 Changelog (pre-release 1):**
- [Client Session API] Do environment checking
- [Command API] Use Avoid type in #sendSyntaxException()
- Change Click.OpenDialog to Identification
- Paper compatibility

